extends ../../../../../designs/mockup-kit/page.pug

include ../mixins/admin.pug

block title
  | icloud-backup — admin · UI mockups

//-
  The read-only admin page: a table of everyone's backup, then the presets for
  libraries that existed before the app, and the form that adds one. Copy and
  sample data are in src/data/admin.mjs.

block content
  +mockHead({ eyebrow: 'icloud-backup · /admin', title: 'Admin', back: true })
    p For lilnas-auth admins. A compact, read-only table at 1280 that becomes a list of cards at 390. Below it, #[+code('Existing libraries')]: the presets that link a lilnas email to a folder and an Immich library, and a form that adds one. #[+code('Add library')] is the one accent button; #[+code('Remove')] is a red outline because it is the only destructive thing here.

  - const d = { copy, cols, rows, libraries, form }
  div(class='vp-scope flex flex-col items-center gap-8')
    +viewportToggle('admin-viewport')
    +viewportPanel('desktop')
      each fr in frames
        +stateRow(fr.label + ' · ' + fr.caption, { stack: true })(class='w-full' id=fr.key)
          +adminScreen('desktop', fr, d)
      +frameLabel Desktop · 1280
    +viewportPanel('mobile')
      +stateRow('States', { stack: true })(class='w-full')
        each fr in frames
          +stateCell(fr.label)(class='w-[390px]')
            +adminScreen('mobile', fr, d)
      +frameLabel Mobile · 390
